    "intro": "腾跃服饰有限公司创立于2011年，坐落于江苏宿迁。从2004年踏入服装行业，历经检验公司、贸易商、外资代表处等多种岗位的历练，积累了深厚的行业底蕴，最终回归初心，创办了这家工厂。\n深耕行业二十余年，我们在江苏、山东两省共设有五家工厂，涵盖样衣制作、版型设计、采购、生产协调到出货清关的完整供应链体系，年产量逾百万件。产品涵盖防晒衣、防风衣、夹克、运动短裤、沙滩短裤、棉服棉衣及儿童服装等多个品类，兼具梭织与PU面料的专业生产能力。\n我们的产品远销多个国家和地区，服务过众多知名品牌与连锁零售商，对不同市场的需求与消费趋势有着丰富的实战经验。我们理解每一位客户背后的压力与期待——交期要准、品质要稳、沟通要顺畅。这些听起来简单，却是我们每天认真在做的事。\n我们不是最大的工厂，但我们有一支稳定、用心的团队。我们相信，真诚的合作比任何华丽的承诺都更有价值。如果您正在寻找一个可以长期信赖的生产伙伴，腾跃团队随时期待与您携手同行。",
    "introEn": "Tengyue Garment Co., Ltd. was founded in 2011, based in Suqian, Jiangsu Province. Our journey in the apparel industry began in 2004, growing through years of hands-on experience across inspection agencies, trading companies, and foreign representative offices — before coming full circle to build this factory from the ground up.\nWith over two decades in the industry, we now operate five factories across Jiangsu and Shandong provinces, covering the full supply chain from sample making and pattern design to purchasing, production coordination, and customs clearance. Our annual output exceeds one million garments, spanning a wide range of categories including sun-protective clothing, windbreakers, jackets, sports shorts, beach shorts, padded coats, and children's wear — with expertise in both woven fabrics and PU materials.\nOur products reach customers across multiple countries and regions, serving well-known brands and retail chains worldwide. We have built a deep understanding of diverse market needs and consumer trends. We know what our clients care about most — on-time delivery, consistent quality, and clear communication. Simple as that sounds, it's what we show up to do every single day.\nWe may not be the largest factory, but we have a stable, dedicated team that takes pride in every order. We believe that genuine partnership outlasts any polished pitch. If you are looking for a reliable, long-term manufacturing partner, the Tengyue team is ready to grow together with you.",
